{"id":"c27bfe92f372d3ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-finite-index.md","title":"Finite Index","display":"df-finite-index — Finite Index","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finite-index","aliases":["58-df-finite-index"],"display":"df-finite-index — Finite Index","depends_on":["[[58-df-subgroup]]","[[58-df-group]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finite-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finite-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-index — Finite Index"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,G\\in V\">\\(H,G\\in V\\)</span> (group objects)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\)</span> (group and subgroup predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S(H,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(\\{\\{g\\cdot h:h\\in H\\}:g\\in G\\})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}index} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteIndex}_S(H,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(\\{\\{g\\cdot h:h\\in H\\}:g\\in G\\})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition refers to the finite set of left cosets, rather than equating a cardinal notation 